<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπόρ-ιστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορίζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to procure</i> or <i>secure</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				3p.63U.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sent.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				469
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup. Praef.</u>
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπεχόνη, οἰκία</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.424
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>; <i>feasible</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				7.1.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπόριστα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρμακα</span>), τά,
				<i>common, family medicines</i>: title of work by <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Eup.Praef.</u>
			</span></i> (called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ ἁπλῶν
			φαρμάκων</span> in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
			</span></i>); also, <i>ordinary food</i>, opp. <i>game out of
			season</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>providing one's subsistence with ease</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				155
			</span></i>.</div>
